					<![CDATA[
						 <p>TEAM RR BEST TEAM IS: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5950867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602362859" alt="KaraKatt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5950867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" >KaraKatt</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602362859" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" >not_a_seagull</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-pighead" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3242824&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602362859" alt="The Pighead" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3242824)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-pighead" >The Pighead</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6479803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602362859" alt="HarryBlank" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6479803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" >HarryBlank</a></span>. Each of us contributed significantly to this tale! You can try guessing who did what, or check out the collapsible below.</p> <p>As always, thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602362859" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span> for havin' a look-see and makin' suggestions.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;WHO&nbsp;DID&nbsp;WHAT!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;What&nbsp;who&nbsp;what?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>1. Dan's headache - HarryBlank<br /> 2. Calvin arrives - KaraKatt<br /> 3. The bet - The Pighead<br /> 4. King's legacy - The Pighead<br /> 5. Probably memetic or something - The Pighead<br /> 6. Those two guys - HarryBlank<br /> 7. Metal Gear Crow - HarryBlank<br /> 8. Bowe alone - HarryBlank<br /> 9. Meetings suck - HarryBlank<br /> 10. Ceiling dog - HarryBlank<br /> 11. Alpha-9/Lambda-2 also appearing in this story - HarryBlank<br /> 12. What's in an acronym? - not_a_seagull<br /> 13. You're fired - HarryBlank<br /> 14. The team-building exercise from hell - HarryBlank<br /> 15. The movie version - The Pighead<br /> 16. All the anomalies are here - Harry Blank<br /> 17. Military intelligence - HarryBlank<br /> 18. The battle ends - HarryBlank</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;ARTICLES&nbsp;REFERENCED&nbsp;IN&nbsp;THIS&nbsp;TALE!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;ARE&nbsp;PRETTY&nbsp;WACKY&nbsp;YO!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-058">SCP-058</a>: Heart of Darkness</strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http:/